Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:01:00.62,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}对轻咬示好的小猫们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:06.44,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我们由此相视而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:12.61,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我们永远如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:15.64,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}该是多么平静
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:18.16,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是爱意袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:21.93,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越发急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:24.74,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.74,0:01:25.24,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.59,0:01:28.04,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}就选你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:30.75,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&773333&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:31.04,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:33.76,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&443333&\blur4}就非你不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:36.30,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\3c&A777CA&\fad(120,120)\an9\t(400,700,\3c&999944&)}如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.61,0:01:39.00,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\blur4\3c&A777CA&}能像小猫轻咬般你侬我侬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:44.00,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\3c&A777CA&\blur4}这么直到永远就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:47.91,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&A777CA&\t(500,2400,\3c&95B990&)}倘若我们认真起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.22,0:01:50.55,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}心痛是在所难免的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:51.90,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&D777C3&\blur4\t(300,1200,\3c&579BE3&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:53.87,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\3c&579BE3&\blur4\t(0,1900,\3c&55BA79&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.87,0:01:56.32,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4\t(0,2500,\3c&C777C3&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.49,0:01:56.85,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\frz-90\fn@\an4\pos(1800,404)\blur4\3c&C777C3&}而我许下愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:01:58.99,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\frz-90\fn@\an4\pos(1800,404)\blur4\3c&000000&}而我许下愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:01.96,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\frz-90\fn@\an4\pos(1800,334)\blur4}希望成为那温柔的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:02.65,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\an3\3c&000000&\blur4}与你相恋的甘神
